{"id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-homology.md","title":"Homology","display":"df-homology — Homology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homology","aliases":["58-df-homology","Homology","Homology Theory"],"display":"df-homology — Homology","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homology</span><span>Homology</span><span>Homology Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homology — Homology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md\">../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_*,\\partial\\in V\">\\(C_*,\\partial\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>二参数复形编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\">\\(C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_n(C_*,\\partial)\">\\(Z_n(C_*,\\partial)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_n(C_*,\\partial)\">\\(B_n(C_*,\\partial)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x]_n^{C_*,\\partial}\">\\([x]_n^{C_*,\\partial}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_n(C_*,\\partial)\">\\(H_n(C_*,\\partial)\\)</span> 为下式定义的集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{H,n}(C_*,\\partial)\">\\(+_{H,n}(C_*,\\partial)\\)</span> 为下式定义的商群运算图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CycleGroup}\">\\(\\mathrm{CycleGroup}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md\">../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\ \\to\\\nZ_n(C_*,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,\\partial).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\ \\to\\\nZ_n(C_*,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{CycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,\\partial).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\ \\to\\\nB_n(C_*,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,\\partial).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\ \\to\\\nB_n(C_*,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}_S(n;C,\\partial).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nC_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land x\\in Z_n(C_*,\\partial)\\ \\to\\\n[x]_n^{C_*,\\partial}\\coloneqq\n\\{y\\in Z_n(C_*,\\partial):\\exists b\\in B_n(C_*,\\partial)\\;+(n)(\\langle x,b\\rangle)=y\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nC_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land x\\in Z_n(C_*,\\partial)\\ \\to\\\n[x]_n^{C_*,\\partial}\\coloneqq\n\\{y\\in Z_n(C_*,\\partial):\\exists b\\in B_n(C_*,\\partial)\\;+(n)(\\langle x,b\\rangle)=y\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\ \\to\\\nH_n(C_*,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\{[x]_n^{C_*,\\partial}:x\\in Z_n(C_*,\\partial)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\ \\to\\\nH_n(C_*,\\partial)\\coloneqq\\{[x]_n^{C_*,\\partial}:x\\in Z_n(C_*,\\partial)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nC_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\ \\to\\\n+_{H,n}(C_*,\\partial)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[x]_n^{C_*,\\partial},[y]_n^{C_*,\\partial}\\rangle,\n[+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle)]_n^{C_*,\\partial}\\bigr\\rangle:x,y\\in Z_n(C_*,\\partial)\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nC_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\ \\to\\\n+_{H,n}(C_*,\\partial)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle[x]_n^{C_*,\\partial},[y]_n^{C_*,\\partial}\\rangle,\n[+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle)]_n^{C_*,\\partial}\\bigr\\rangle:x,y\\in Z_n(C_*,\\partial)\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Homology: cycles modulo boundaries</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_0\">\\(H_0\\)</span>: path components</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_1\">\\(H_1\\)</span>: abelianization of fundamental group</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_n\">\\(H_n\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-dimensional holes</li>\n<li>Long exact sequence: connects homology of pairs</li>\n<li>Mayer-Vietoris: homology of union</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Spanier, Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{BoundaryGroup}$、$\\mathrm{CycleGroup}$ 取 [[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C_*,\\partial\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C_*,\\partial)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"C_*=\\langle C,+\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)","display":false},{"tex":"Z_n(C_*,\\partial)","display":false},{"tex":"B_n(C_*,\\partial)","display":false},{"tex":"[x]_n^{C_*,\\partial}","display":false},{"tex":"H_n(C_